PART 6 — SAFE FUNCTION DESIGN (VERY IMPORTANT)
Rule for Google interviews
👉 Never mutate inputs unless explicitly required
Instead:
def safe_add(lst):
    new_lst = lst.copy()
    new_lst.append(100)
