✅ Safe design
def add_item(lst):
    new_lst = lst.copy()
    new_lst.append(10)
    return new_lst
⭐ Google-style explanation
“To avoid side effects, I avoid mutating input arguments directly. Instead, I work on copies and return new objects, unless mutation is explicitly required by the API.”
